WEBVTT

00:03:28.162 --> 00:03:30.289
into a thousand pieces.

00:03:31.165 --> 00:03:35.920
Desperate, Odin sought help 
from the most skilled makers of all:

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:37.213
the Dwarves.

00:03:37.588 --> 00:03:41.676
Rather than metal, they sought 
the rarest ingredients;

00:03:41.676 --> 00:03:45.388
from feline footsteps and fish breath

00:03:45.388 --> 00:03:49.058
to the sinews of mountains 
and mighty bears.

00:03:49.308 --> 00:03:52.144
With these, the Dwarves crafted Gleipnir,

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:56.857
an unbreakable chain in the guise 
of fine thread.

00:03:57.191 --> 00:04:02.530
When Odin challenged Fenrir a third time, 
the wolf laughed.